      "cooked": "<p>Hello Community,</p>\n<p>I tried to setup cronjob for <code>biometric-attendance-sync-tool</code> as below.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">$ crontab -l\n\n0 */6 * * * cd /home/sigma/frappe-bench &amp;&amp; /usr/local/bin/bench --verbose --site all backup &gt;&gt; /home/sigma/frappe-bench/logs/backup.log 2&gt;&amp;1 # bench auto backups set for every 6 hours\n* * * * * /usr/bin/python3 -c 'from erpnext_sync import main; main()'\n</code></pre>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/4/14581de8398860f7026f01c8ee83025fb9ed5c69.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/14581de8398860f7026f01c8ee83025fb9ed5c69\" title=\"74682306_DESIGN12832024_20625\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/4/14581de8398860f7026f01c8ee83025fb9ed5c69.png\" alt=\"74682306_DESIGN12832024_20625\" data-base62-sha1=\"2TYl0tVxrcqRmKtorkZrhZvWtYJ\" width=\"690\" height=\"104\" data-dominant-color=\"252627\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">74682306_DESIGN12832024_20625</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×194 7.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This cronjob is not working when I am restarting PC and starting Ubuntu or Windows Terminal.</p>\n<p>But when I run the script manually ( using commands <code>source venv/bin/activate</code> and <code>python3 erpnext_sync.py</code> in dir <code>biometric-attendance-sync-tool</code> ) and then stops the script using <code>ctrl + Z</code> then cronjob works fine.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/2/12455880b32037485e3705e7406cfa237db7465b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/12455880b32037485e3705e7406cfa237db7465b\" title=\"74682306_DESIGN12832024_201651\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/2/12455880b32037485e3705e7406cfa237db7465b.png\" alt=\"74682306_DESIGN12832024_201651\" data-base62-sha1=\"2BDalQKbolEX4eVdCuTmLik116H\" width=\"690\" height=\"133\" data-dominant-color=\"212223\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">74682306_DESIGN12832024_201651</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×247 11 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>May I know How to run this cronjob perfectly when I restart computer.</p>",
